      "content": "that makes sense. i think we also need to cover the more physical side of things. sometimes, when people are acting in that 'wild' or irrational way, they can start acting very small, or maybe they're quick and darting around the room, almost like they're possessed or something. how do you train staff to read those specific types of erratic movements or behaviors?",
